Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Seventh Episode\NThe Magic Tree
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.02,0:01:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,\Ntoday we present to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...the second part\Nof "Mephisto's Spell"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.34,0:02:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We remind you what happened\Nin the first part,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,presented\Nin the previous episode.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.94,0:02:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, Hecate's mother,\Nturns Sapphire into a doll,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.46,0:02:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,commanding her to go\Ntowards Mephisto's cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.74,0:02:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile Hecate, who refused\Nto become a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.66,0:02:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,runs away from home.\NOn the road she meets Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,...and takes her\Nto the kingdom of Goldland,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.06,0:02:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,where Prince Franz lives,\NSapphire's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.46,0:02:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince,\Nwilling to give refuge to Sapphire,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.14,0:02:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,notices that the girl\Nhe is infatuated with...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...is, in reality, Sapphire herself\Nand decides to protect her from Mephisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But the evil Hell tracks down\NSapphire at Goldland castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.46,0:02:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...and, to take her back, turns\Nthe inhabitants of the castle into stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.62,0:02:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince fights with Hell\Nand with Mephisto, risking his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,but Hell defeats him\Nand takes Sapphire away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.62,0:02:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Franz...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.46,0:03:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so sad,\NPrince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.78,0:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitty, you speak! Don't fear, I\Nwon't reveal your secret to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.38,0:03:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- You understand my pain, don't you?\N- Yes, I understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, if only I could have\Nmy Sapphire back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire! Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.22,0:03:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.66,0:03:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Damned Mephisto,\Ndon't be so cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my Sapphire! I offer\Nyou my life in exchange for hers!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.78,0:03:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz,\NI know where Sapphire is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You know where she is? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.94,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I'm doing\Nthe right thing by telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.94,0:03:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But you must tell me! Please,\Ntell me right now where she is! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a moment,\NI'm going to check!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.10,0:04:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad must have\Ncertainly taken her to the cave!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What would they say if I brought\NPrince Franz down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.38,0:04:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if they scold me,\Nbut they might treat him badly...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,.and I really don't like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a huge problem! But I have to\Nsolve it one way or another.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.78,0:04:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So, kitty, did you check?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see which direction\Nthey took? Quick, tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.86,0:04:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I saw that they went\Nthat way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.82,0:04:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, Sapphire! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.18,0:04:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a situation I've gotten myself into!\NHow will it end?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Franz,\Nall I can do is trust in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.02,0:05:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm so annoyed!\NWhere has Hecate gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Try consulting\Nyour crystal ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.86,0:05:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're reduced to consulting\Nthe crystal ball...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,..to know where our daughter is,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,who goes out without even\Ntelling her parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.46,0:05:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Here are the consequences of\Nthe upbringing that you gave her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.70,0:05:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so shrewish, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.14,0:05:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe she isn't coming back precisely so\Nshe doesn't have to hear your grumbling!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Don't talk nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.38,0:05:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And look: the crystal\Nball is blackened!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.46,0:05:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so lazy that you don't\Neven take care of your things!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now clean it, if you\Nwant to use it! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Today I feel depressed! Who\Nwouldn't be with a wife like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.46,0:05:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop complaining, you\Nlazybones! And keep polishing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.14,0:05:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz won't be able to find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.34,0:06:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When Hecate returns home,\NMephisto will not waste time...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.38,0:06:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...and will immediately\Nexchange my heart with hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I must escape before she returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.50,0:06:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,How strange... I feel like I've\Nalready passed through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.54,0:06:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you making me go in circles, kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.58,0:06:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth: do you really\Nknow where Sapphire is?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.50,0:06:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, I know!\N- Then tell me exactly where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, look, she should\Nbe... She's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.66,0:06:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You say she's locked in\Nthat house? Let's go see!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.02,0:06:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, where are\Nyou? It is I: Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's Mephisto who's\Npreventing her from answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.18,0:07:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find her anyway!\NMaybe she's here! Or here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.50,0:07:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Franz.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.86,0:07:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me a lie, kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire is not in this house!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.30,0:07:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Franz, I didn't\Nmean to deceive you! I'm not a liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just that I felt so\Nsorry for you, so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.06,0:07:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, well! Finally you have revealed\Nyourself for what you are, kitty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're an agent of Mephisto, right?\N- Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.22,0:07:36.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Mephisto, don't mock me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my life\Nin exchange for Sapphire's!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.74,0:07:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I would like to help him, but\Nhow can I do it? I have an idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.30,0:07:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Show yourself, Mephisto! Show yourself!\N- Prince Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.22,0:07:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, is it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.42,0:07:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Franz! I\Nmanaged to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.18,0:08:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sapphire! How\Nhappy I am to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.90,0:08:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,How wicked I am...\NI am deceiving him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.26,0:08:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But how I wish he would\Nsee me as Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.22,0:08:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, why is there\Nthat tear on your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.02,0:08:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! Don't go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.06,0:08:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, what is happening\Nto you? Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Prince\NFranz, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not Sapphire! In reality, I\Nam Hecate, the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.82,0:08:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It was always me,\Neven that little kitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.18,0:08:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are really the daughter of\NMephisto, what do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.22,0:08:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You were so sad that\NI tried to comfort you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,by taking on the appearance of\NSapphire. I beg you, Prince, forgive me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.90,0:08:58.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive you?! How can I forgive\Nyou? You were only mocking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only a diabolical soul\Ncould devise such a trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! How I wish I\Nwasn't the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There, now it’s nice and shiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- Look how marvelous, dear!\N- Let me see!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.10,0:09:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire has escaped!\N- What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.22,0:09:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! She escaped while I was polishing the sphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.06,0:09:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,One more effort...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.14,0:09:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape! Now I'll catch you again and take you back to your cell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.94,0:09:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- And make sure you don't escape again!\N- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.66,0:10:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, Sapphire!\NYou wanted to escape, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.30,0:10:03.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.82,0:10:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This way she won't escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone! You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- You bastard!\N- It's no use resisting!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.66,0:10:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!\NI'll have to polish it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!\NI'm sorry for what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.98,0:10:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I understand that, after all,\Nyou wanted to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.90,0:10:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You disguised yourself as Sapphire with good\Nintentions, to bring me comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.34,0:10:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, I believe there is\Nonly one way to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.62,0:10:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? And what would it be?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.34,0:10:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that it was\Nmy parents who kidnapped her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.66,0:10:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,so she must be\Nlocked up in our house.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then tell me:\Nwhere is your house located?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.62,0:11:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, wait!\NNo matter how strong you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.06,0:11:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,you can never hope\Nto surpass my parents!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.42,0:11:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,- But...\N- But?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.06,0:11:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If you blinded them,\Nyou might succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.34,0:11:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Blind your parents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.86,0:11:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But only for a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,At the top of the Mountain of Ghosts\Nthere is a tree:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.14,0:11:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,they say its sap makes\Nanyone who drinks it lose their sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.66,0:11:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mountain of Ghosts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.02,0:11:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.30,0:11:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Kitty! Oop-la!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.42,0:11:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you transformed yourself, Hecate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.66,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad are looking for me\Nwith the magic sphere,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.54,0:12:02.06,Default,,0,0,0,,so I created a double of myself\Nto escape them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.10,0:12:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make her walk through the woods,\Nso they'll think I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.30,0:12:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Little sister, walk while singing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.42,0:12:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a Prince I love\Nand he doesn't know it yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.78,0:12:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's Hecate!\NDarling, I found where Hecate is!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.06,0:12:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, they found her!\NThen it's over for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.62,0:12:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,She's in the woods, at the foot\Nof Ghost Mountain
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.66,0:12:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?!\NMove, go there immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, alright! I'm running!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.58,0:12:43.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't come back if you\Nhaven't found her, damn the devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.18,0:12:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, usually\NI'm not so vulgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:13:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The Prince is far away, he\Ndoesn't realize that I love him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.42,0:13:08.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- The Prince is far away...\N- Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you go away! Your\Nmother is furious, you know? Now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it was just an image!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.10,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate! Can I know\Nwhere you've gotten to?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.74,0:13:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the tree\Nof the evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.06,0:13:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother told me that\Nwhoever touches it is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's nothing else\Nto be done, unfortunately!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.18,0:13:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay here, Prince\NFranz! I will go on alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.54,0:13:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.58,0:13:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.90,0:14:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You are in danger, Hecate!\NGo back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.02,0:14:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The evil spirit is angry,\Nbut I must do it anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.06,0:14:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Hecate, come\Nback here! It will hurt you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.14,0:15:21.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.86,0:15:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This sap is enough\Nfor what I have in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we must go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.10,0:15:45.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate, what's wrong?\N- I feel terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.70,0:15:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the evil spirit's curse\Nupon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.14,0:15:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you knew about the curse\Nand you wanted to go anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.02,0:15:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.18,0:16:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If my parents find you, you won't\Nbe able to save Sapphire anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.66,0:16:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We must hurry,\Nso follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.82,0:16:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Franz,\Ndon't move from there...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...until I give you a signal.\N- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.38,0:16:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Where on earth could Hecate have gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.86,0:16:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.78,0:16:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- Papa!\N- Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.86,0:16:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally back home!\NMy little girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.70,0:16:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Darling, Hecate is here! She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, some good news!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.02,0:16:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, my child! Where have you\Nbeen? We've been so worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scold her, dear! Ever since\Nshe returned, she seems very unwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She's unwell? She has a guilty conscience\Nfor having made us suffer so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.14,0:17:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But now we will perform\Nthe operation immediately...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...to swap her heart with Sapphire's.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,- Isn't it better to wait?\N- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.58,0:17:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,If the operation must be done,\Nit's better that it's done right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.38,0:17:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.02,0:17:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, now have Sapphire brought here!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.26,0:17:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.66,0:17:29.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Help! Help, Franz! Help!\N- But that's Sapphire's voice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.10,0:17:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.06,0:17:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sapphire! I have\Nto wait for Hecate's signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.62,0:17:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for, my\Ndaughter? Lie down here, next to Sapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.86,0:17:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Has the moment arrived when\NI will become a great witch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.14,0:17:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you're feeling sick, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:57.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Afterward, you'll be able\Nto recover from any illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.78,0:18:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll become much\Nmore capable than I am now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.38,0:18:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to toast to this?\N- Certainly, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.38,0:18:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel well...\NMother, can I ask you a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you want, little one,\Nand don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon you will feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.50,0:18:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that decent people\Nnever fail to make a toast
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,when they are about to celebrate\Nsomething.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.70,0:18:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Decent people"?! You want me\Nto make a toast? But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.82,0:18:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me a glass, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- To the birth of a\Ngreat witch! - Cheers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.90,0:18:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, mother and father...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.46,0:18:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?\NI can hardly see anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.26,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Franz, come here! Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, why on earth are you calling Franz?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you, Hecate?\NWhat the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.42,0:19:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz! - There's the signal!\NHecate is calling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- Franz, hurry up!\N- What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.30,0:19:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Could Prince Franz have come\Nto take Sapphire back?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.58,0:19:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dammit, I can't see anything!\N- Sapphire! Sapphire, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.22,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up! Escape, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.70,0:19:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you saved me! I will\Nbe forever grateful to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.70,0:19:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, you dared to betray\Nyour parents?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.86,0:19:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I have already received\Npunishment from the evil spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?!\N- Yes, perhaps I will die for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.34,0:19:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Flee with us, Hecate! I can't\Nbear the thought of you dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I hear! Hecate is\Ndying?! No, for heaven's sake! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.90,0:19:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, Sapphire, let's take her away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.54,0:19:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! I won't let you escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could see\Nwhere they are! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.34,0:20:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Devil of a woman! She\Nhit me instead of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We must try to get through\Nat all costs, Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Run, Sapphire!\NFollow me or they'll catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.38,0:20:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm following you, Franz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.58,0:20:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch them! Catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.46,0:20:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn you!\NGet out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- My daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.10,0:20:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Courage, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord, save my friend Hecate,\Neven if she is the daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.34,0:21:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she is the daughter of the devil,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.34,0:21:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,her soul is purer\Nthan any other.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.38,0:21:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Free her from the curse!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.58,0:21:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Hecate is opening her eyes!\NPraise be to God! You're safe, Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? God?! But I'm in a church!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.34,0:21:41.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out, quick,\Notherwise I'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.78,0:21:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget that I am\Nthe daughter of Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.22,0:21:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But Hecate, we brought you here\Nto make you heal!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.74,0:21:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Far from dying! It's here, in\Nchurch, that you have come back to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.98,0:21:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,God saved you because, although\Nthe daughter of Mephisto, you have a pure soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The Lord has freed you from the\Ncurse of the evil spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.10,0:22:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange that Mephisto's\Ndaughter is being helped by God...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.06,0:22:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,..and in a church, no\Nless! Don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.26,0:22:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, actually\Nyou're an angel to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.86,0:22:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad are looking for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.30,0:22:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.30,0:22:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hecate, we beg you!\NCome home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.54,0:22:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We got our sight back!\NDon't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.66,0:22:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We apologized to the evil\Nspirit and to the Great Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Everything is fine now!\N- We won't be mean to you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.98,0:22:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, come home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.82,0:22:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hecate!\N- Hecate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:44.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom and Dad worry about me
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.22,0:22:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you want to return, Hecate?\N- Thank you so much, Hecate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.50,0:22:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hail Mephisto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.18,0:22:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.62,0:22:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Hecate! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.18,0:23:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire.\N- Yes, Franz?
